<title>HONG KONG: Trading of Fu Hui shares suspended.</title>
<headline>Trading of Fu Hui shares suspended.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading in shares of jewellery concern Fu Hui Jewellery Co (H.K.) Ltd was suspended at the company's request pending an announcement, the Hong Kong stock exchange said on Wednesday.  </p>
<p>Fu Hui shares rose HK$0.10 or 23.26 percent to end at HK$0.53 per share on Tuesday. Volume was 6.56 million shares worth HK$3.19 million.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (8952) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
